Lithic symbols
==============

symbols.go holds icons from Material Symbols by Google
(https://github.com/google/material-design-icons), the Sharp style at weight 400
and 24 px, taken from the official SVGs at commit 10ecc147 (symbols/web/<name>/
materialsymbolssharp/). They are converted from SVG path data to IconVG; the
shapes are otherwise unchanged. list.txt names the symbols included.

Material Symbols are released under the Apache License 2.0, whose full text is
in the LICENSE file beside this notice; that license is compatible with Ryoku's
GPL-3 distribution.
